WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.240
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.240
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:09.180
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:09.180
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:19.750
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.690
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.710
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.710
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.150
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.150
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.920
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.920
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.200
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.200
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.640
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.640
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:45.230
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:45.230
it waits nearby.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:49.690
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:49.690
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.760
I can say love

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.490
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.490
It overflows with love.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.490
will you love me?

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:57.100
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:57.100
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.050
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.050
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.610
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.610
The shape of your love,

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:08.260
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:08.260
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:27.380
I'd like to welcome everyone to the GP Academy!

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:30.100
This academy was created as
a short-term training course

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.130
to instruct GP cadets how to
preserve the peace of the galaxy

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:36.350
and protect the welfare of the people.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:41.600
Therefore, our curriculum also
consists of on-the-job training.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:46.160
There is no doubt many of you here
will find the training very difficult.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:51.780
Yet I pray with all my heart that
all you GP cadets before me today

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:56.390
will graduate from this
academy as model GP officers.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:00.930
Never lose hope and never quit working hard

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:02.910
so that one day you too, will become a fine officer.

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:04.880
Good luck!

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.500
Next is the freshmen speech.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.240
Freshmen representative, Yamada Seina.

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.840
R-Right!

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.180
Do you think he'll be all right?

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:22.890
I've never seen anyone look that nervous before.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:30.010
T-The freshmen speech...

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.880
Why?!

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:02.600
Entering the GP Academy

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:04.850
Line up!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:08.420
Today, due to computer problems,

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.860
all classes but a select few have been canceled!

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:13.990
And I think we can all assume who's to blame...

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.760
It looks like he's really got it in for you.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:18.490
But it isn't my fault.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.160
All right! Twenty laps around the track!

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:22.330
100 push-ups! 100 sit-ups!

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:25.440
And then do that entire routine five times!

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.860
For superior students such as yourselves,

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:30.220
this kind of routine should
feel like a simple warm-up.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:33.600
I have complete faith you can
do it with no trouble at all.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.800
Superior students such as yourselves, right?

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.240
Get ready!

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.160
How come...?

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.500
35...

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.550
36...

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.550
37...

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:24.810
38...

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:33.400
He's really got it in for Seina, doesn't he?

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:38.380
Yamada Seina-kun...

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:41.360
You haven't finished the
entire routine yet, have you?

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.410
I follow the principle of
treating all my students equally.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.910
So that's how they do that on Earth?

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:55.990
Quitting the academy isn't necessarily a failure.

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:58.070
It's a way of finding a new path.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.400
Everyone has their own different path to find.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:03.930
One needs courage to accept his own
mistakes and start all over again.

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:07.840
I truly believe that you are a man of courage.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.810
If you're going to turn back,
you should turn back early on.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.100
Kiriko-san...

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:23.600
Oh my, he's really sweating out there!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.450
Not to mention his hard work
and guts; how great youth is!

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:31.960
You're not going to tell
him to hang in there?

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.630
That man is so repulsive, isn't he?

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:38.840
He knows Seina hasn't undergone
body enhancement yet,

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:41.090
but he's still running him ragged.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:43.470
The GP is a dangerous job.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:45.910
Being as unlucky as he is,

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:50.480
Seina-kun won't make it far
without enhanced strength.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.480
Well, we can start on his body enhancement

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.150
as soon as the computer trouble is taken care of.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:57.820
Oh, he tripped! Now he's back up! What a trooper!

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:00.860
Oh, a bird just pooped on him!

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.990
He's got the worst luck!

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.260
Seina-kun is trying his absolute hardest!

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.490
How can you laugh at him?!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:17.250
So just tell him to hang in there.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:25.860
He must really hate you.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.090
Even though you're supposed to
get your body enhancement first,

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.390
he's making you do the exact same stuff as us.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:35.960
He told me to my face that he hates
Earthlings when we met yesterday.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:39.460
That's how they are, whether they're
officers in the GP or in the military.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:43.800
And besides, your real training right
now is more mental than physical.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.490
You must be one revolting student then.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:48.910
I'm <i>not</i>  going home!

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:51.120
Line up!

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.880
Hang in there!

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:18.610
Yep, they're definitely superior...

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:20.540
Don't you think it's a little strange?!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.570
What is?

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:26.320
I've never heard of computer
maintenance ever taking this long.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.680
Yeah, you're right...

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:30.410
We just can't seem to do his
body enhancement either, huh...

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:31.650
Seina's I mean.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.950
M-My class schedule is what I'm worried about.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.710
Hello there, fair maidens.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:38.320
How are you today?

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.710
Why do you gotta sit next to me?!

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:45.260
There's no need to say such cold hearted things...

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:47.460
Didn't we grow up together as friends?

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.770
Yeah, we did.

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:51.300
Then you tried to take my skirt off and

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:53.100
wound up being chased by my pet, Garuga.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.100
Garuga

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:57.140
Then you pissed your pants, rolled down the
hill crying, and fell into the ocean.

00:07:57.140 --> 00:08:00.040
They found you three hours later
caught inside a giant fishing net.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.940
Ever since then...

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.580
I should be running along now...

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.450
I'm a bit exhausted, you see.

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.120
You don't do your job enough to get exhausted.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.360
I have this one student who wears me out, though.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.820
I believe his name is Yamada Seina...

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:17.860
Or something like that.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:22.460
Oh, that reminds me. You know
him, don't you, Masaki-sensei?

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:25.840
It looks like Seina-kun is really troubling you.

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.540
No, no, he's trying hard.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:31.180
If he can keep up with my training regimen,

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:34.410
he'll surely become a superb member of the GP.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.580
But isn't it a little too demanding for him?

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.100
He still hasn't undergone
body enhancement, you know...

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:42.480
I have faith that he, if anyone, can do it!

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:47.930
Isn't it the duty of a teacher to
draw out a student's potential?

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:49.670
And if you can't draw his out?

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.280
When that happens...

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:53.490
it's in his best interest
to drop out of the academy.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.900
Yes! You're absolutely correct!

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.540
I'm so happy that you understand!

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:03.040
Now that I think about it, aren't you
in charge of his body enhancement?

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.710
Yes, that's right.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:10.950
Which is why I wish for him to
undergo it as soon as possible.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:14.350
But I have a suspicion the computer
repairs will take a little more time.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:17.890
Well then, I bid you adieu.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:18.890
Hey, you!

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:22.600
Gimme back my fork! My fork!

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:24.810
Say, Seina...

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:27.320
Why not just skip class until you've
undergone your body enhancement?

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:30.070
No, I have to keep at
this or she won't accept me...

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:30.820
Who?

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:39.380
Sorry.

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:41.580
This is the first time a
system crash of this magnitude

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.080
has ever happened in the
history of the Galactic Academy...

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:45.880
I see...

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:48.960
And after everything you said back there...

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:52.720
It turns out you really <i>were</i> worried about Seina.

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.260
A-Amane!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:56.800
So, how much longer will it take?

00:09:56.800 --> 00:10:00.060
The class curriculum system takes top priority,

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:01.570
so I'll have that done sometime tomorrow.

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:05.810
But it'll still be a while until I
can get to the body enhancement system.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.140
Please do your best.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:12.570
Understood.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:16.780
Is it really okay to do something this selfish?!

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:18.950
I'm not sure this is a good idea!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.120
What are you saying?!

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:23.830
Body enhancement is extremely dangerous!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:31.730
Isn't it my duty as a teacher to ensure
the absolute safety of my student?

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.340
That's quite gallant of you.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:39.970
He's exceptionally lucky to have
such a kind instructor as myself.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:46.140
I'm paying close attention to my poor
student to ensure the best for him!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.900
What are you doing?!

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:52.040
That chip is very important!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.420
You are truly terrific, Tennan-sensei.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:01.660
To think that you would look out
for one of your students this much.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.460
W-Well, that's what good teachers do.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:06.580
But...

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.750
Y-Yes?

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:16.340
I never thought that I, of all people,
would get stuck doing this...

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:18.910
Hey, Seiryo-chan! We need to hurry!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.100
Right!

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:35.400
I asked you two to come here for a specific reason.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:38.630
Tennan-sensei was in charge of
 Yamada Seina-kun's body enhancement,

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.570
but he was recently given a
different, special assignment...

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:43.230
These filthy devices are finally all–

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:45.270
Ok! Everything's spotless in here!

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.790
Well then, I need to be going now–

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.670
Time for the next one!

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.740
Y-You can't be serious!

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:52.540
So I thought I would choose one of you two

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:55.610
to take his place as Seina's
body enhancement supervisor.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:56.630
What do you think?

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:59.780
What do you mean, "What do we think?"

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.290
Fine, I'll do it.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:02.120
No!

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.890
Why not?

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:05.220
It's just that...

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:07.860
I guess there's no other option, then.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.530
I'll do it.

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:11.270
No, you can't!

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:15.200
Body enhancement is a process in
which nano-machines are implanted

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:19.240
into the body to strengthen muscles
and improve reflexes and kinesthesis,

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.170
thereby vastly increasing strength,
endurance, and healing ability,

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:25.440
not to mention the rate of cellular mitosis,

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:30.550
which effectively extends the
subject's physical life span.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:32.000
Now do you understand?

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.000
Not really...

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.290
Well, in simple terms, think of it as a system

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:40.010
in which anybody can become a
"super man" and live a long life.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:41.590
Uh... okay...

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:46.020
I've been chosen to be your body
enhancement operator, so don't worry.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:47.400
Um...

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:51.240
Is it absolutely required that I
get this body enhancement stuff?

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:52.800
Are you scared?

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:58.990
No, it's just that making my body
more like a machine is sort of...

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:02.750
Maybe it's unheard of back on your home world,

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:05.380
but it's a common thing here,

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:09.250
and as you are now, you can't
keep up with the training, right?

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:13.460
Yeah, but won't I die if the procedure fails?

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:18.530
Don't worry. I've never heard of
anyone whose body enhancement failed.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.860
Really?

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.270
But if by some chance something does happen,

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:26.640
I'll take full responsibility and
take care of you with all my heart.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.210
Um, that tickles...

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.380
Kiriko-san...

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.250
I need to talk to you.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.450
Do you have time?

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:47.950
A long time ago, you, Kai, and
I used to go to the ocean a lot.

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.430
We did, didn't we?

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:51.810
I used to get stung by jellyfish, or almost drown,

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.830
or cut my feet on broken glass bottles.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.390
Seina-chan!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.410
Seina-chan.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.250
Yes?

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:15.190
Even with that intense training,
do you still want to be in the GP?

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:18.080
Well, the training is tough,

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:22.070
but I'm getting body enhancement soon...

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:24.800
If you undergo the GP's body enhancement procedure

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:29.950
you might never be able to
live on Earth like you used to!

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:32.770
There are all types of body enhancement.

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.570
The GP's is meant for combat.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:38.300
They alter the very basic components of your body!

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.300
And...

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:45.150
once they've done it, even if you
could return to your original body,

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:48.450
remnants of those components would still be left!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:51.500
Afterward, even Earth's medical technology

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.150
could easily tell you're not a regular human!

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:56.960
So there are all kinds of things
you won't be allowed to do!

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:01.800
Visiting doctors, falling in love
with people on Earth, even marriage!

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:03.760
You, never going to the hospital again?

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.400
Unthinkable, isn't it?

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:09.970
And even though it's highly unlikely, in the
worst case, in order to maintain secrecy,

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.290
you might die of an injury that
could otherwise be easily treated!

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:16.540
B-But it's highly unlikely, right?

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.420
Not for you, Seina-chan!

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.340
T-That's...

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:22.940
Even so, do you still want to be in the GP?!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:25.910
Even so, do you still want to be here?!

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:28.990
You still have time!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.650
Seina-chan, go back to Earth!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:38.480
Um...

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:41.100
I'm sorry, Kiriko-san.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.810
I'm determined to be in the GP.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:44.740
Why?

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:49.480
After all, it looks like my
mom and dad are happy for me,

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:52.620
and I have to send them
money once in a while too.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.110
Seina!

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:58.790
More than anything else,
I want to be in space.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:02.590
If I pass this up, I'm sure I'll
never have a chance like this again!

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:06.380
I want to go to all kinds of places on
spaceships and see all kinds of things!

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:09.480
But it's dangerous!

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:11.450
You might even die!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.070
Even if I did stay on Earth,

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.270
that still wouldn't change my bad luck.

